   "source": [
    "## 12. Test-only geometry and train-prototype evaluation\n",
    "\n",
    "- `Dintra`：每个 class 内所有 unordered pair 的平均 cosine distance，再 macro-average；利用向量和公式精确计算，不建立完整 pair matrix。\n",
    "- `Dinter`：L2-normalized class centroids 之间的平均 cosine distance。\n",
    "- `Dinter / Dintra`：separation ratio，越高越好。\n",
    "- Prototype accuracy：train class centroids → test samples。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 27,
   "id": "9d215203",
   "metadata": {
    "tags": [
     "geometry"
    ]
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
