    "## 13. Frozen-encoder linear probe\n",
    "\n",
    "冻结 CNN，只在 train `h` 上训练一个线性层；feature standardization 也只使用 train `h`。Best probe state 由 validation balanced accuracy 决定，最后只在 test 上评估。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 46,
   "id": "b9fc0efd",
   "metadata": {
    "tags": [
     "linear-probe"
    ]
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Linear probe epoch 001 | loss=3.21838, val BA=0.20865\n",
      "Linear probe epoch 020 | loss=0.12933, val BA=0.32564\n",
      "Linear probe epoch 040 | loss=0.06220, val BA=0.32083\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/html": [
       "<div>\n",
