   "source": [
    "## 14. Unsupervised test-user diagnostics\n",
    "\n",
    "在 `z_test` 上运行 KMeans（`K = #classes`），不向聚类算法提供 labels；然后计算：\n",
    "\n",
    "- NMI（arithmetic normalization）；\n",
    "- ARI；\n",
    "- supervised-label silhouette（cosine distance，class-balanced subsample）。\n",
    "\n",
    "这些指标是 diagnostics。Coarse label 可能天然 multi-modal，因此不作为唯一主结论。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 50,
   "id": "ad1eb3f1",
   "metadata": {
    "tags": [
     "unsupervised-diagnostics"
    ]
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Silhouette computed from 275 eligible samples across 51 classes.\n",
      "Skipped 1 singleton class(es) as silhouette queries.\n",
      "Skipped singleton class indices: [49]\n",
      "Skipped singleton labels: ['x']\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/html": [
       "<div>\n",
